Package: blugon-lite
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-urwid, libx11-6, libxrandr2, x11-xserver-utils
Description: Blue Light Filter for X Window System
 blugon-lite adjusts your screen's color temperature based on the time
 of day, reducing blue light during evening hours to improve sleep
 quality.
 .
 Features:
  - Automatic color temperature adjustment
  - Interactive TUI for easy configuration
  - Multiple preset schedules (evening, office, student, etc.)
  - Custom themes (dark, dracula)
  - Lightweight (< 8MB RAM)
  - Automatic saving of configuration changes
 .
 This package includes:
  - blugon-lite: CLI command for applying the filter
  - blugon-lite-tui: Interactive TUI for configuration
